        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;MTP: patient-specific soft-tissue simulator for robotic ultrasound&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:13px'&gt;SonoGym-style gym with a GPU linear FEM, model-based B-mode, learned and heuristic scan policies, a 1 kHz robot runtime streaming to 3D Slicer, pre-registered studies and live demos&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=0;fontSize=22;fontColor=#1f2430;fontStyle=0;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
